\{\{\overline{x_1}, \overline{x_2},  \overline{x_4}\},\{\overline{x_1}, \overline{x_3},  \overline{x_5}\},  \{\overline{x_2}, \overline{x_4},  \overline{x_6}\},  \{\overline{x_3}, \overline{x_5},  \overline{x_6}\}\}$. For readability the edges inside the cliques $K$ and $K'$ are not shown. The figure is based on a corresponding figure from~\cite{LMPS24}.}
