All local gates now pass again after the fixes. The only unresolved requirement is external: a fresh hardening attempt still receives HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” before any model produces a scored answer. I’m doing a final deterministic/stress audit locally and will leave the oracle status explicitly unscored rather than misreporting quota failures as model failures.
